&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Atari&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atari is an interactive entertainment company and an iconic gaming industry brand recognized worldwide for its multi-platform games and licensed products. Atari owns and/or manages a portfolio of more than 400 games and franchises, including globally recognized brands such as &lt;em&gt;Asteroids®&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Centipede®&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Missile Command®&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Pong®&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;RollerCoaster Tycoon®&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
